Model Registry	fraud-detector-v2@champion	Points to Version 1	Passed
Inference Server	curl -i http://localhost:5001/health	HTTP/1.1 200 OK	Passed
Monitoring Script	/root/code/monitor.sh	Exit status 0	Passed

